@startuml
' Business symbols extracted from course PPT PDF pages 86-87. System uses the business entity symbol.
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ActorBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBorderColor transparent
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 ActivationBorderColor black
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
}
actor "患者" as P
participant "<img:business-worker.png>\n收费人员" as C
participant "<img:business-entity.png>\n牙科诊所管理系统" as S
P -> C : 请求结算本次诊疗费用
activate C
C -> P : 核实患者与本次就诊（c）
P --> C : 提供姓名及本次就诊信息
C -> S : 查询本次待结算费用
activate S
S -> S : 读取已确认项目及数量\n按适用单价计算应收
S --> C : 返回项目明细及应收金额
deactivate S
C -> P : 核对收费项目及应付金额
P --> C : 确认费用并交付现金
C -> C : 清点实际收到的款项
C -> S : 登记本次现金收款及实收金额
activate S
S -> S : 保存本次收款\n计算找零并标记结清
S --> C : 返回结算结果、找零金额及收据
deactivate S
C -> P : 交付收据及找零，确认结清（d）
deactivate C
@enduml
